89|export const SPLIT_HELP = `How to split it:
90|- Split by responsibility into small modules, one concern per file, roughly under 300 lines.
91|- Put shared types in their own file.
92|- Move fixtures and test data to fixtures/ or public/.
93|- For TS/JS create a folder with an index.ts that re-exports the pieces so imports stay stable.
94|- For docs split by heading into docs/<topic>/*.md with a short index.
95|- For tests split per behavior.
96|- Never minify or remove comments to sneak under the limit.
97|- If the file really is generated or third-party, add its pattern to the ignore list in this script and explain why in the commit message.`;
